  "_comment": [
    "",
    "Appending is expected and welcome:",
    "  id    the game item id, the only field that identifies the item. Take it from",
    "        the Item ID row on the wiki infobox (the id1 field in the raw page), or",
    "        from https://prices.runescape.wiki/api/v1/osrs/mapping for tradeables.",
    "  name  a human cross-check only. Nothing looks an item up by name. For tradeables",
    "        it must match /mapping exactly, so variants read as the game writes them",
    "        ('Serpentine helm (uncharged)', not 'Serpentine helm').",
    "",
    "Untradeable items belong here. Fire cape, Barrows gloves and Rubber chicken have",
    "no GE price, so price modes skip them, but they are prime material for a render",
    "or examine question.",
    "",
    "Keep the list sorted by name so appends land predictably and rarely conflict."
